        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "6563) published in the Official Gazette dated November 5, 2014, and numbered 29166 (the “E-Commerce Law”) is applicable to all of our online services to the extent we provide commercial services to our users through our online platform.",
        "start_character": 65784,
        "end_character": 66020
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "According to the Law on Internet Crimes and the E-Commerce Law, we, as a hosting service provider and as intermediary service provider, respectively, have no liability in relation to the content listed by third parties or any illegality related to goods listed or services provided by such third parties on our platform, unless we receive a notification of the unlawful or illegal content and do not take any action (including removing unlawful content).",
        "start_character": 78600,
        "end_character": 79054
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Acting as an electronic commerce service provider through Direct Sales on our online platform, we are also required to comply with the obligations provided for electronic commerce service providers under the E-Commerce Law and the E-Commerce Regulation.",
        "start_character": 77692,
        "end_character": 77945
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a “hosting services provider” as well as “content provider” for our Direct Sales under the Law on Internet Crimes, we are required to comply with the relevant provisions in relation to illegal content that might be posted on our online platform and notification requirements envisaged under the Law on Internet Crimes and its secondary legislation.",
        "start_character": 65250,
        "end_character": 65601
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we provide fulfillment services to 124 companies.",
        "start_character": 39301,
        "end_character": 39375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At Hepsiburada, we are driven by our mission to improve people’s lives by developing innovative products and services.",
        "start_character": 12063,
        "end_character": 12181
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For merchants selecting the HepsiLojistik model, we provide storage and fulfillment services at our fulfillment centers.",
        "start_character": 50636,
        "end_character": 50756
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If the seller objects by submitting the documents and information specified in the E-Commerce Law in full, and it is clearly understood from the information and documents that the seller is right in his/her objection, we re-publish the product for sale within 24 hours and we inform the third-party intellectual property right owner and the seller.",
        "start_character": 79657,
        "end_character": 80005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we receive a complaint from a third-party intellectual property right owner related to an illegal activity and/or content (including intellectual property infringement or sale of counterfeit product), on condition that the third-party intellectual property right owner submits all the mandatory information and documents as detailed in Article 12 of the E-Commerce Regulation, we remove the product/products subject to the complaint within 48 hours, and then we inform the third-party intellectual property right owner and seller of the product with explanations about the seller’s right to object.",
        "start_character": 79055,
        "end_character": 79656
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2017, we launched Hepsijet, our own delivery service which provides last-mile delivery services (inclusive of scheduled same day and next day delivery).",
        "start_character": 2652,
        "end_character": 2807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In July 2021, we completed our initial public offering and listed our ADSs on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “HEPS.”",
        "start_character": 351,
        "end_character": 485
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-053195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-053195-ef1e0021cb8729b7",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-053195",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Marketplace, we do not charge merchants for setting up an online storefront on our Marketplace, but receive a Marketplace commission and transaction fee if the merchants’ sales are successful and depending on the type of service we provide.",
        "start_character": 36315,
        "end_character": 36562
      }
